DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261102
DTSTAMP:20261025T144727Z
UID:f92813cb758f70e07204ddb44c15@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:It’s the Fall harvest season so what better way to celebrate
  and welcome in the cooler weather than with a short 20-minute round trip 
 ride on a vintage train to the Danbury Railway Museum’s Pumpkin Patch. T
 his popular annual family fund-raising event will take place on October 10
 -11\, 17-18\, 24-25\, 31\, and November 1 beginning at 10:00 AM at the mus
 eum\, with trains departing at 11:00 AM\, 12 noon\, 1:00 PM\, 2:00 PM\, an
 d 3:00 PM. On Saturday evenings\, an additional twilight train will depart
  at 6:30 PM with special activities at the patch.\n\nSource: https://ctvis
 it.com/events/ride-husking-bee-pumpkin-patch-train-1
LOCATION:Danbury Railway Museum\, 120 White Street\, Danbury CT\, 06810
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/ride-husking-bee-pumpkin-patch-train-1
END:VEVENT
